---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Beijing Travel Blog: Tips, Guides & Ideas" description="Beijing travel tips, in-depth attraction guides, seasonal weather advice, and curated itinerary ideas to help you plan the perfect trip to Beijing.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 pb-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-base-900 mb-3">Beijing Travel Blog</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-base-500 leading-relaxed mb-8">Travel tips, seasonal advice, and in-depth guides for your Beijing trip.</p>
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <article class="border-b border-base-200 pb-10">
        <p class="text-sm text-base-400 mb-1">August 8, 2026</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2"><a href="/blog/cost-of-beijing-trip/" class="text-base-900 hover:text-accent transition-colors">How Much Does a Beijing Trip Cost? 2026 Budget Guide</a></h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">Real 2026 costs for flights, hotels, attractions, food, and transport — with daily budgets for budget, mid-range, and luxury travelers, plus a sample 5-day breakdown.</p>
        <a href="/blog/cost-of-beijing-trip/" class="text-sm text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium">Read article &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="border-b border-base-200 pb-10">
        <p class="text-sm text-base-400 mb-1">July 31, 2026</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2"><a href="/blog/beijing-travel-tips/" class="text-base-900 hover:text-accent transition-colors">Beijing Travel Tips: 20 Things to Know Before You Go</a></h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">Essential advice for first-time visitors: VPN setup, subway navigation, attraction booking, cultural etiquette, and all the practical stuff guidebooks skip.</p>
        <a href="/blog/beijing-travel-tips/" class="text-sm text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium">Read article &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="border-b border-base-200 pb-10">
        <p class="text-sm text-base-400 mb-1">July 31, 2026</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2"><a href="/blog/what-to-eat-in-beijing/" class="text-base-900 hover:text-accent transition-colors">What to Eat in Beijing: 15 Must-Try Dishes and Where to Find Them</a></h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">From Peking duck to street-side jianbing: discover 15 essential Beijing dishes with specific restaurant recommendations for every budget.</p>
        <a href="/blog/what-to-eat-in-beijing/" class="text-sm text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium">Read article &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="border-b border-base-200 pb-10">
        <p class="text-sm text-base-400 mb-1">July 31, 2026</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2"><a href="/blog/where-to-stay-in-beijing/" class="text-base-900 hover:text-accent transition-colors">Where to Stay in Beijing: Best Areas for Tourists</a></h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">Choose the best neighborhood for your trip. Compare Dongcheng, Xicheng, Chaoyang, Haidian, and more &mdash; with picks for every budget and travel style.</p>
        <a href="/blog/where-to-stay-in-beijing/" class="text-sm text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium">Read article &rarr;</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
